   "ANSWER": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1403\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1471\" data-start=\"1403\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2125\" data-start=\"1833\">A trapdoor is a hidden entry point into a program allowing bypass of security checks.<br data-end=\"1658\" data-start=\"1655\" />\n\t<strong data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1658\">Example:</strong> A developer inserts a secret password in software for unauthorized later access.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
