 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 13259,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"8111\" data-start=\"7758\"><strong data-end=\"7771\" data-start=\"7760\">Answer Key:</strong></p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"2831\" data-start=\"2257\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2184\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2223\" data-start=\"2187\"><strong data-end=\"2221\" data-start=\"2187\">Trojan Horse (Program Threat):</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2227\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2280\" data-start=\"2227\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2280\" data-start=\"2229\">Malicious code hidden within legitimate software.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2284\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2286\"><em data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2286\">Example:</em> Free software installing keyloggers.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2336\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2368\" data-start=\"2339\"><strong data-end=\"2366\" data-start=\"2339\">Virus (Program Threat):</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2372\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2433\" data-start=\"2372\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2433\" data-start=\"2374\">Attaches to files/programs and replicates upon execution.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2437\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2439\"><em data-end=\"2449\" data-start=\"2439\">Example:</em> File infecting viruses corrupting executable files.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2677\" data-start=\"2504\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2555\" data-start=\"2507\"><strong data-end=\"2553\" data-start=\"2507\">Denial of Service (System/Network Threat):</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"2677\" data-start=\"2559\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2619\" data-start=\"2559\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2619\" data-start=\"2561\">Overwhelms system resources making services unavailable.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2677\" data-start=\"2623\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2677\" data-start=\"2625\"><em data-end=\"2635\" data-start=\"2625\">Example:</em> Flooding web server with fake requests.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2847\" data-start=\"2678\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2713\" data-start=\"2681\"><strong data-end=\"2711\" data-start=\"2681\">Sniffing (Network Threat):</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"2847\" data-start=\"2717\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2781\" data-start=\"2717\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2781\" data-start=\"2719\">Intercepts data packets over a network to steal information.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2847\" data-start=\"2785\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2847\" data-start=\"2787\"><em data-end=\"2797\" data-start=\"2787\">Example:</em> Capturing login credentials over unsecured Wi-Fi.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
